   531→                <p style={{ color: '#666', marginBottom: '1rem' }}>Path construction, winding fill rule, Bezier curve tessellation for smooth curves.</p>
   532→                <ul style={{ lineHeight: 2, color: '#555' }}>
   533→                  <li><strong>GPath Construction</strong> – Moveto, lineto, quadto, cubicto path building</li>
   534→                  <li><strong>Winding Fill Rule</strong> – Non-zero winding rule for complex path filling</li>
   535→                  <li><strong>Quadratic Bezier</strong> – Smooth quadratic curves with adaptive tessellation</li>
   536→                  <li><strong>Cubic Bezier</strong> – Complex cubic curves with adaptive subdivision</li>
   537→                  <li><strong>Path Transformation</strong> – Apply arbitrary matrix to path vertices</li>
